  "description": "LIFNEV crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C108 H156 Dy6 N6 O30. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy1A (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2A (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3A (Dy) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 11 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.578-3.646 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 100.72-112.39°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C108H156Dy6N6O30. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ4-O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
